                            <comment id="455529" author="paf0186" created="Fri, 9 May 2025 22:50:33 +0000">&lt;p&gt;Note this info is already available in other places, but is harder to get.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="455551" author="adilger" created="Sat, 10 May 2025 13:17:01 +0000">&lt;p&gt;See &lt;a href="https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-18934" title="report OST IO latency stats by IO size" class="issue-link" data-issue-key="LU-18934"&gt;&lt;del&gt;LU-18934&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt; for similar work that is in progress on the server side. &lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Note that modifying existing stats files can be problematic for tools that scrape these stats, though I suspect it is less of a concern on the client than on the server...&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="455552" author="adilger" created="Sat, 10 May 2025 13:18:13 +0000">&lt;p&gt;It may also be useful to have a stat somewhere that tracks the number of sync writes for debugging purposes. &lt;/p&gt;</comment>
